{"title":"Snakeskin Feet","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Tailoring Lv 16) · Monster drop: Small Copperhead, Sirocco, Copperhead, Pit Mother</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-req\"><b>Requires</b> Lvl 15 · INT/MAG 45 <span class=\"muted\">to equip</span></p>\n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Tailoring at level 16 <span class=\"muted\">(375 XP)</span> from 1× <a href=\"#/item/snakeskin-knick\">Snakeskin Knick</a>, 2× <a href=\"#/item/wool\">Wool</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"small-copperhead\" title=\"Small Copperhead - Normal, 0.6% of recorded drops (2 / 358 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/79167631ab2fcb600a3d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Small Copperhead</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.6%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"sirocco\" title=\"Sirocco - Normal, 0.2% of recorded drops (1 / 425 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/09b45d3b4d34c05d314b.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Sirocco</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.2%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"copperhead-medium\" title=\"Copperhead - Normal, 0.3% of recorded drops (1 / 336 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/b134e63b0f937131e7db.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Copperhead</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.3%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"pit-mother\" title=\"Pit Mother - Normal, 9.1% of recorded drops (1 / 11 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/9965d945c9da53ffbe27.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Pit Mother</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">9.1%</span></div></div><div cla